      <div type="clause" n="32.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 32.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ æt ðam oðran cyrran ne sy ðær nan bot buton þæt heafod.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And on the second occasion he shall not be able to make any amends except by his head.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ æt ðam oðran cyrre ne si þær nan oðer bót butan þæt heafod.</ab>
